	which is the source of truth for this icon (owner's decision).

	Pure #FFFFFF, as in the SVG. It was briefly an indigo gradient, to stop the icon reading as an empty tile
	on a light launcher; that is not the artwork, so it is gone. If the white tile turns out to disappear into
	the wallpaper, the fix belongs in app_icon.svg, not here.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
		android:width="108dp"
		android:height="108dp"
		android:viewportWidth="108"
		android:viewportHeight="108">
	<path
			android:fillColor="#FFFFFFFF"
			android:pathData="M0,0h108v108h-108z" />
</vector>
